[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Bounded Diode Constant-Charge Profile

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: MODEL-006
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Explicit immutable capacitance variation metadata
STATEMENT: >>>
Diode parallel-capacitance variation shall identify its farad-valued parameter explicitly, return a validated new circuit and preserve conduction parameters and the original source circuit. The legacy default diode scalar remains saturation current in amperes. Legacy diode profiles shall not be silently upgraded, and no previously compiled factorization may be reused after changing C.
<<<
