Implementation: src/variation.rs::diode_capacitance_selection and replace_diode_capacitance. Verification: tests/model_charge.rs metadata, source immutability, unchanged G/changed Q, independent saturation replacement and malformed target/value rejection. JSON scalar sweep's existing default scalar semantics remain unchanged.
<<<
