STATEMENT: >>>
A distinct diode-with-capacitance profile shall compose the unchanged Shockley current/Jacobian with constant parallel Q stamps, preserving terminal polarity and legacy diode construction/wire behavior. DC, biased AC and bounded nonlinear BE shall consume the same validated parameters; unsupported integration/model options shall fail explicitly.
