[REQUIREMENT]
UID: MODEL-004
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Immutable model identity and explicit conduction observables
STATEMENT: >>>
Compiled diodes shall retain their original element identity rather than rediscovering it by matching equal floating-point model parameters. Legacy diode currents retain i(id). A constant-charge profile shall label its derived static-current signal i_conduction(id), including AC incremental conduction, and shall not invent a transient initial displacement current from an unspecified derivative. Total current verification may use independently constrained source branches.
<<<
COMMENT: >>>
Implementation: src/compile.rs and src/api.rs. Verification: tests/model_charge.rs parallel identical legacy diodes, explicit profile signal identity and independent source/conduction DC/AC/BE equations. New profile domain validation also precedes configured initial observers.
<<<
